Subject: Keep only the English Snowball stemmer
Purpose: The standard build links stemmers for about 28 languages and creates a text search configuration for each at initdb. The profile needs text search to work, not 28 languages, so only the English UTF-8 stemmer and its configuration are kept (the Makefile of this release generates the configurations from its LANGUAGES list, so the list is cut to english). Other text search configurations are not created; to_tsvector with 'english' and 'simple' work as before. Same effect as common/0004 for 16 and later, made for the older way this directory is built.
Components: src/backend/snowball/dict_snowball.c, src/backend/snowball/Makefile
Checks: scripts/native-image.sh test (to_tsvector english stems foxes to fox; pg_ts_config lists exactly english and simple)
Origin: own

